 "_notes": {
  "hypotheses UPDATE": "Row-lock only. hypothesis_evidence_guard() runs SELECT ... FOR UPDATE on hypotheses as the invoking role, which needs UPDATE. Any actual UPDATE is rejected by the hypotheses_immutable trigger, which the runtime role cannot disable (it owns nothing and has no TRIGGER privilege).",
  "bounty_* (0011)": "Bounty collection: no DELETE anywhere (delisted listings are marked, merged programmes keep their row); program changes are append-only; sources are seeded by the migration and only their state columns are updated.",
  "worker api (0015)": "Option D: the worker-API tables are written by the API's owner connection only; the runtime role gets nothing on them. hypothesis_evaluation_keys is written by the after-insert trigger on hypothesis_evaluations (as the inserting role), so INSERT is needed wherever evaluations are inserted; evaluation_provenance is written by the direct worker beside its evaluations.",
  "research independence (0016)": "analysis_identities is a seeded, append-only reference table; the views and analysis_generator_family are read-only."
 }
